Annotations on common gameplay-path block tick methods:
- ButtonBlock: PROPAGATES — toggles POWERED, triggers neighbour update
- SculkSensorBlock: PROPAGATES — phase transitions emit redstone signal
- FallingBlock: spawns FallingBlockEntity, removes block (maySpawnEntities)
- FireBlock: 5x5x5 spread + 3x3x3 ignite (high random budget)
- DispenserBlock: dispenses items/projectiles into facing direction
- BubbleColumnBlock: column update walking from below

Total annotations: 66 (up from 60). Per arch §14.3 DG2 target ~130; ~51% complete.

